abstract: >-
  groundtrack is an open-source Python library for seismic
  waveform acquisition and processing for atmospheric
  re-entry events. It automates the full pipeline from
  orbital TLE retrieval to processed seismic waveforms,
  enabling systematic analysis of space debris re-entry
  trajectories and fragmentation dynamics.
